          "text": "Associated symptoms and red-flag features"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No fever, shortness of breath, facial or tongue swelling, or mucosal involvement. No red-flag features for SJS/TEN, cellulitis, or anaphylaxis were noted."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
